## Database Engine

Lament uses **LibSQL** hosted on **Turso** for its database. The client library is `@libsql/client`.

## Schema

The database schema is defined in `schema.sql`:

### Core Tables

**`artists`** — Music artist records.

| Column | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | TEXT PK | UUID |
| `name` | TEXT | Artist name |
| `slug` | TEXT UNIQUE | URL slug |
| `image_url` | TEXT | Artist image URL |
| `image_source` | TEXT | Image provider |
| `created_at` | TEXT | Timestamp |

**`albums`** — Album records linked to artists.

| Column | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | TEXT PK | UUID |
| `artist_id` | TEXT FK | Reference to artists |
| `title` | TEXT | Album title |
| `slug` | TEXT | URL slug |
| `cover_url` | TEXT | Cover image URL |
| `year` | INTEGER | Release year |
| `type` | TEXT | Album type |

**`tracks`** — Individual music tracks.

| Column | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | TEXT PK | UUID |
| `artist_id` | TEXT FK | Reference to artists |
| `album_id` | TEXT FK | Reference to albums |
| `title` | TEXT | Track title |
| `audio_url` | TEXT | HLS playlist URL |
| `duration` | INTEGER | Duration in seconds |
| `source` | TEXT | Audio source (default: youtube) |
| `original_id` | TEXT UNIQUE | Spotify/YouTube ID for dedup |

**`lyrics`** — Lyrics with language and variant support.

| Column | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | TEXT PK | UUID |
| `track_id` | TEXT FK | Reference to tracks |
| `language` | TEXT | Language code (en, id, jp) |
| `variant` | TEXT | original, translated, romanized, synced |
| `content` | TEXT | Lyrics content |

### Relationship Tables

- **`track_categories`** — Many-to-many: tracks ↔ categories
- **`track_artists`** — Many-to-many: tracks ↔ artists (for features/collaborations)

### System Tables

- **`clients`** — API client keys with `key_hash` and `is_active` status
- **`requests`** — User song request queue with `status` tracking (pending/done/rejected)
- **`maintenance`** — System maintenance state

## Migrations

Run migrations with:

```bash
cd lament-api
bun run db:push
```
